# Which surface made the second white line

At the same frozen plunge-bottom camera, coloring the water mesh identified the long pale stripe on the water side of the foam. Suppressing the previous water-edge lace at that same world position removed the stripe while the rounded foam remained on its own mesh. Extending the magenta shoulder farther into the river made the foreground too broad. The saved source uses the narrower band and relocates the white contact line.

The four 432 × 768 pictures in this folder record those diagnostic shader settings. Full-size gameplay and the complete films are in the main comparison folders.
